            "notes": "Round 1 is all about hitting your right click shots. Use [Coulder](item_12ad88e8-650a-44ec-b1e1-a39646055d68) to push enemies off the map or push the opponents back in a crunch and also use it as a safe getaway skill. Get headshots and farm money.\n\nAlternatively, you could go for [Iceberg](item_312193a7-1f88-462f-93fe-9a60f4462d47), but imo without much AP in earlier rounds its not that useful.\n\nHowever, you could definitely get [Extendothermics](item_501fc89f-a7b4-46c5-a43f-b65ab0958438) if you think you will be doing less right clicks but then this build is all about rightclicks only.\n\n\nIf you do not like the roll build, go for [Snowball Flight](item_770c6b61-98a8-489f-b44e-c1cc65c0cd7d) instead.",
